====Usage notes====
* {{m|ru|ребя́та}} is one of the two nominative plurals of {{m|ru|ребёнок}}, and applies only in the meaning "boys, friends, comrades", not in the meaning "children". It has a neuter form but is grammatically masculine, since the singular {{m|ru|ребёнок}} is masculine.

